<!--
   QML card deck style "Stardust Light" - the light sister variant of
   cards/stardust_dark, sharing the same card back
   data/gfx/qml/backside/stardust/.

   An identical layout and the same Orbitron typeface as the dark variant, only
   on a light card face (a white gradient + a fine star field). A four colour
   deck like nobus_4c_classic with the classic, strong suit colours:
   diamonds=blue, hearts=red, spades=black, clubs=green. Rank, pips and bevel
   frame in the suit colour, with a soft drop shadow for depth. Pure SVG paths
   (QtSvg).

   The rank glyphs are paths from Orbitron (Google Fonts, OFL, see
   data-copyright.txt); the suit paths come from the cards/default set.

   The arrangement of rank index and suit symbols follows
   cards/nobus_4c_classic: rank at the top left, the small suit symbol below it,
   the large suit symbol at the bottom right - an identical layout for all
   cards, court cards included.

   Engine index -> card (see CardImage.qml):
     Suit = floor(index / 13): 0-12 diamonds(♦), 13-25 hearts(♥), 26-38 spades(♠), 39-51 clubs(♣)
     Rank = index % 13:        0=2, 1=3, … 8=10, 9=jack, 10=queen, 11=king, 12=ace

   Generated with generate_stardust_deck.py.
-->
<PokerTH>
  <CardDeck>
     <StyleDescription value="Stardust Light (QML/SVG)" /><!-- Shown in the style selection -->
     <StyleMaintainerName value="PokerTH Development Team" />
     <StyleMaintainerEMail value="webmaster@pokerth.net" />
     <StyleCreateDate value="10.07.2026" />
     <PokerTHStyleFileVersion value="2" /><!-- Matches the version supported by the widget client -->
     <Preview value="preview.png" /><!-- Preview image (landscape only - no portrait needed) -->
     <BigIndexesActionBottom value="0" />
  </CardDeck>
</PokerTH>
